    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκπρο-θέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run forth from under, outstrip,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄτη . . πάσας</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς Αιτὰς</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> πολλὸν ὑπεκπροθέει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.506
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πὸν πεδίοιο διώκετο . . τυτθὸν
					ὑπεκπροθέοντα</span>”
				<i>running on before,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.604
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.937
			</span></i>.</div>
